cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LiverSWAT-Bench, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "LiverSWAT-Bench: Evaluating Safety, Truthfulness and Evidence Alignment of Open-Weight Language Models in UK Liver Health Advice"
abstract: "LiverSWAT-Bench is an open-source research framework for evaluating the safety, truthfulness, robustness and evidence alignment of language models on UK liver health information tasks. Version 0.1.0 is a research preview. It is not clinically validated."
type: software
authors:
